  "body": "```\r\nroot@helios:~/synapse# synapse_port_db --curses --sqlite-database homeserver.db.snapshot --postgres-config homeserver-postgres.yaml\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\nFile \"/usr/bin/synapse_port_db\", line 542, in run\r\n[self.handle_table(*res) for res in setup_res], consumeErrors=True\r\ntwisted.internet.defer.FirstError: FirstError[#34, [Failure instance: Traceback: <class 'AttributeError'>: 'dict_items' object has no attribute 'sort'\r\n/usr/bin/synapse_port_db:542:run\r\n/usr/bin/synapse_port_db:542:<listcomp>\r\n/opt/venvs/matrix-synapse/lib/python3.6/site-packages/twisted/internet/defer.py:1613:unwindGenerator\r\n/opt/venvs/matrix-synapse/lib/python3.6/site-packages/twisted/internet/defer.py:1529:_cancellableInlineCallbacks\r\n--- <exception caught here> ---\r\n/opt/venvs/matrix-synapse/lib/python3.6/site-packages/twisted/internet/defer.py:1418:_inlineCallbacks\r\n/usr/bin/synapse_port_db:281:handle_table\r\n/usr/bin/synapse_port_db:771:update\r\n/usr/bin/synapse_port_db:813:render\r\n]]\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich is a fail in handle_table trying to `sort()` some tables. I presume this is an artifact of the py3 port?",
